/* GrapherKit: demos */
"A line piercing a plane" = "直线穿过平面";
"A Lissajous figure and a cycloid. The range of t is set per layer." = "李萨如图形与摆线。参数 t 的范围在每个图层里单独设置。";
"A sphere and a cylinder through its centre axis offset by the radius meet in a figure-eight curve." = "球面与一个轴线偏离球心一个半径的圆柱面相交，得到一条 8 字形曲线。";
"A sphere inside a torus, each given by (x, y, z) = F(u, v). Rotate with the mouse." = "环面里面套一个球面，都由 (x, y, z) = F(u, v) 给出。用鼠标旋转着看。";
"A tangent plane of a parametric sphere; the normal points along the radius to the centre." = "参数球面的一个切平面；法线沿半径方向指向球心。";
"A three-petal rose, a cardioid and an Archimedean spiral." = "三叶玫瑰线、心形线和阿基米德螺线。";
"A tilted circle and its two shadows on the floor: straight down, and along a slanted direction." = "一个倾斜的圆，以及它在地面上的两个投影：垂直向下的正投影和沿斜方向的斜投影。";
"A tilted plane cuts a cone in an ellipse. Make the slope of the plane 1 (a parabola) or larger (a hyperbola)." = "倾斜的平面截圆锥得到椭圆。把平面的斜率改成 1 得到抛物线，更大则得到双曲线。";
"A trefoil knot and a helix, both (x, y, z) = F(t)." = "三叶结与螺旋线，都由 (x, y, z) = F(t) 给出。";
"Change the semi-axes a and b to see how an ellipse and a hyperbola with the same a and b relate." = "改变半轴 a 和 b，观察 a、b 相同的椭圆与双曲线之间的关系。";
"Conic section of a cone" = "圆锥的截线";
"Curves and regions" = "曲线与区域";
"Data and fitting" = "数据与拟合";
"Distance from a point to a plane" = "点到平面的距离";
"Drag the sliders a, b and c to change amplitude, frequency and phase; the curves follow live." = "拖动滑块 a、b、c 改变振幅、频率和相位，曲线实时跟着变化。";
"Ellipse and hyperbola" = "椭圆与双曲线";
"Explicit functions" = "显函数";
"Explicit surfaces" = "显式曲面";
"F(x, y, z) = 0: a torus and a translucent sphere around it, extracted with marching tetrahedra." = "F(x, y, z) = 0：一个环面和包在外面的半透明球面，用四面体步进法求出。";
"F(x, y) = 0: the folium of Descartes, an ellipse and a hyperbola." = "F(x, y) = 0：笛卡尔叶形线、椭圆和双曲线。";
