"Polar curves" = "极坐标曲线";
"Projections and tangent planes" = "投影与切平面";
"Scatter plot with a fitted line" = "带拟合直线的散点图";
"Select the point and the plane in the Relations panel; “Draw Results” adds the foot of the perpendicular." = "在「位置关系」面板里选这个点和平面，点「画出结果」会加上垂足。";
"Shade where F(x, y) is less than, or greater than, zero. Regions overlap with transparency." = "把 F(x, y) 小于或大于 0 的区域涂色，几个区域半透明地叠在一起。";
"Sine wave with sliders" = "带滑块的正弦曲线";
"Skew lines and the common perpendicular" = "异面直线与公垂线";
"Space curves" = "空间曲线";
"Sphere cut by a plane" = "平面截球面";
"Surfaces and space curves" = "曲面与空间曲线";
"Tangent and normal of a cubic" = "三次曲线的切线与法线";
"tangent at x = 1.5" = "x = 1.5 处的切线";
"Tangent plane of a sphere" = "球面的切平面";
"Tangent planes of a paraboloid" = "抛物面的切平面";
"Tangents and normals" = "切线与法线";
"Tangents of a circle and a cardioid" = "圆与心形线的切线";
"Tangents work on parametric (position = t) and polar curves (position = θ) too." = "切线对参数方程（位置填 t）和极坐标曲线（位置填 θ）同样适用。";
"The cut of z = (x² + y²)/3 − 2 by the plane z = x is an ellipse, its shadow on the floor a circle." = "平面 z = x 截 z = (x² + y²)/3 − 2 得到椭圆，它在地面上的投影是圆。";
"The dihedral angle and the line where two planes meet; try tilting one plane by editing its formula." = "两个平面的二面角和交线；改改其中一个平面的公式，试着把它倾斜。";
"The intersection of a sphere and the plane z = 1 is a circle. Hide the surfaces to keep only the curve." = "球面与平面 z = 1 的交线是一个圆。把曲面隐藏起来就只剩这条曲线。";
"The intersection point and the angle between the line and the plane." = "直线与平面的交点，以及直线与平面的夹角。";
"The tangent at x = 1.5 and the normal at x = −0.5 of y = x³ − 3x. Change the position in the inspector." = "y = x³ − 3x 在 x = 1.5 处的切线和 x = −0.5 处的法线。在检查器里可以改位置。";
"Three views of a helix" = "螺旋线的三视图";
"Two cylinders (Steinmetz)" = "两个圆柱面（施泰因梅茨体）";
"Two equal cylinders cross along two ellipses lying in the planes x = ±z." = "两个半径相同的圆柱面相交，交线是位于平面 x = ±z 内的两个椭圆。";
"Two lines that neither meet nor are parallel, their distance and the common perpendicular segment." = "既不相交也不平行的两条直线，它们之间的距离和公垂线段。";
"Two planes and their line of intersection" = "两个平面及其交线";
"Two tangent planes of z = (x² + y²)/4 − 2, each with its normal. Change the point of tangency in the inspector." = "z = (x² + y²)/4 − 2 的两个切平面，各带法线。在检查器里可以改切点。";
"Viviani's curve" = "维维亚尼曲线";
"y = f(x). The curve of 1/x is cut at the pole instead of being joined by a vertical line." = "y = f(x)。1/x 的曲线在极点处断开，不会连出一条竖线。";
"z = f(x, y). A ripple and a saddle; use the opacity slider to see through the saddle." = "z = f(x, y)。一个波纹面和一个马鞍面；用不透明度滑块可以透过马鞍面看里面。";

/* GrapherKit: gradient */
"Gradient field" = "梯度场";
"Gradient" = "梯度";

/* GrapherKit: gradient demos */
"Gradients" = "梯度";
"Gradient on a hill" = "山丘上的梯度";
"Arrows point uphill, longer and redder where the slope is steeper. The top and the flat foot have none." = "箭头指向上坡方向，坡越陡箭头越长、越红。山顶和平缓的山脚没有箭头。";
"Gradient field as a vector field" = "作为向量场的梯度场";
"The same idea as in the textbook: ∇f drawn flat on the floor, always pointing across the contours of the surface above." = "和课本上一样的画法：把 ∇f 平放在地面上，它始终垂直于上方曲面的等高线。";
"Uphill and downhill on a saddle" = "马鞍面上的上坡与下坡";
"Uphill arrows (warm) and downhill arrows (negative length) of a saddle; the saddle point in the middle has none." = "马鞍面的上坡箭头（暖色）和下坡箭头（长度取负），中间的鞍点没有箭头。";
"A gradient field that changes with a slider" = "随滑块变化的梯度场";
"Drag s to make the hill wider or narrower: the steepest ring moves and the arrows follow live." = "拖动 s 让山丘变宽或变窄：最陡的那一圈会移动，箭头实时跟着变。";

/* GrapherKit: gradient flow */
"Gradient flow lines" = "梯度流线";
"Flow" = "流线";

"Climbing to two summits" = "攀向两座山顶";
"Paths that follow the gradient from different starting points end on different summits. Press play on p to roll the balls along." = "从不同起点沿梯度走的路径，会停在不同的山顶上。在参数 p 上按播放，小球就沿路径滚动。";
"Gradient descent in a narrow valley" = "窄谷里的梯度下降";
"Following −∇f downhill into the valley: the path first drops across the steep walls, then slides along the floor. Press play on p." = "沿 −∇f 往谷里走：路径先沿陡峭的谷壁下坠，再沿谷底滑行。在参数 p 上按播放。";
